WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.197 --> 00:00:04.096
- I was 12 years old when
I first got trafficked.

00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:07.277
(somber music)

00:00:07.277 --> 00:00:09.777
My home life was very violent.

00:00:11.024 --> 00:00:13.575
Because of the things that
I'd been trough in my life,

00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:16.553
being sexually molested at a young age,

00:00:16.553 --> 00:00:20.961
having a family member not
believe me when I told them

00:00:20.961 --> 00:00:23.639
that it happened by the
hands of a family member,

00:00:23.639 --> 00:00:26.943
I felt that no one was there to protect me

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:29.360
and no one cared or loved me.

00:00:30.628 --> 00:00:32.441
When I was 12 years old

00:00:32.441 --> 00:00:34.156
I was a runaway.

00:00:34.156 --> 00:00:36.262
I was just walking around in the streets

00:00:36.262 --> 00:00:38.266
and a guy pulled up on the side of me

00:00:38.266 --> 00:00:39.937
and asked me if I was okay.

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:42.110
I told him I was fine and
I started to walk away

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:44.122
and it started to rain.

00:00:44.122 --> 00:00:46.113
And he was like, "Just
come sit in the car with me

00:00:46.113 --> 00:00:47.436
"until the rain stops."

00:00:47.436 --> 00:00:49.496
I was cold and wet so I agreed.

00:00:49.496 --> 00:00:52.695
I was basically kidnapped and um,

00:00:52.695 --> 00:00:55.362
raped and beaten, sold for days.

00:01:00.581 --> 00:01:03.951
So from that moment on, I
just stayed in the streets.

00:01:03.951 --> 00:01:07.604
I couldn't imagine myself
getting out of that situation.

00:01:07.604 --> 00:01:08.724
I felt worthless.

00:01:08.724 --> 00:01:11.244
I had little to no self esteem.

00:01:11.244 --> 00:01:14.548
I would literally work
early in the morning

00:01:14.548 --> 00:01:18.712
and I would see kids
my age going to school

00:01:18.712 --> 00:01:22.894
and it was hard for me
to look at those kids

00:01:22.894 --> 00:01:25.644
because there was a lot of shame.

00:01:33.254 --> 00:01:36.784
The one way that I was able
to get a break from the life

00:01:36.784 --> 00:01:39.380
was to basically go into a store

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.752
and steal in plain sight while my pimp

00:01:41.752 --> 00:01:43.540
was outside in the car.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:47.196
If I was caught stealing, I
would eventually get arrested

00:01:47.196 --> 00:01:49.147
and I would go to juvenile hall.

00:01:49.147 --> 00:01:52.011
For most girls or most kids

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:54.547
they will see it as a punishment,

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:57.318
but it was structure in my life.

00:01:57.318 --> 00:01:59.334
It was a safe place and I knew that

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.272
no one will be able to harm me.

00:02:01.272 --> 00:02:05.439
My life basically changed
once I was beaten by my pimp.

00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:09.887
And I was in a hospital
for a short stint of time

00:02:09.887 --> 00:02:12.887
and I knew that this was my way out.

00:02:13.949 --> 00:02:18.116
I was turning 18 and there
was no more safety net,

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.552
so if I was to get in trouble,

00:02:21.552 --> 00:02:24.072
if I was to steal to get away from a pimp,

00:02:24.072 --> 00:02:25.255
I was going to the county

00:02:25.255 --> 00:02:27.585
and that was a whole 'nother world that I

00:02:27.585 --> 00:02:29.223
did not want to be a part of.

00:02:29.223 --> 00:02:32.827
So, I took that opportunity
to leave California

00:02:32.827 --> 00:02:34.764
in hopes of leaving the life.

00:02:34.764 --> 00:02:37.660
I realized that I was a victim

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:40.320
and then I became a survivor.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.320
And now, I am a warrior.

00:02:43.754 --> 00:02:46.587
(uplifting music)

00:02:55.811 --> 00:02:58.119
(sighs)

00:02:58.119 --> 00:02:59.536
what I would tell

00:03:00.715 --> 00:03:02.810
a 12 year old me.

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:05.898
I would tell the 12 year old me that

00:03:05.898 --> 00:03:08.100
it's going to get better.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.370
I will tell her that,

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:14.369
"Your life may seem like it's
being sacrificed right now,

00:03:14.369 --> 00:03:17.686
"but it's going to help
so many other women,

00:03:17.686 --> 00:03:19.686
"so just keep on going."

